    "reason": "The linked PR [ev-13ff01be5828] describes ko support as a developer-loop aid. Its concrete changes are a new \"ko mode flag\" in the Helm chart that rewrites the image to the ko:// form, and init-container path changes. The changed files [ev-98534b0ca5d3] include cluster/charts/crossplane/values.yaml, and [ev-1791bf083f9e] says the defaults are unchanged. This makes the real subject most likely an added helm-value rather than a new product relationship with ko. However, none of the excerpts gives the values.yaml key path, so a correct assertion cannot be written. The missing piece is the name of the ko-mode key added to values.yaml (or the README diff that documents it).",
